    "body": "v0.2+ needs a fresh deploy. Add `scripts/deploy-bounty-escrow.sh`. It should:\n- build the release WASM\n- `stellar contract deploy` using a named stellar CLI identity (no secrets in the repo)\n- `initialize(admin)` and allowlist the native XLM SAC\n- print a JSON snippet for `data/deployments/testnet.json`\n\n## Acceptance\n- [ ] The script is idempotent-safe (fails clearly if the identity is missing)\n- [ ] It is documented in docs/REPRODUCIBILITY.md",
